    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720070/extras/2d50348a4ce523ce2c57f9f1c95ffb33.poster.avif?t=1751637899\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720070/extras/2d50348a4ce523ce2c57f9f1c95ffb33.webm?t=1751637899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720070/extras/2d50348a4ce523ce2c57f9f1c95ffb33.mp4?t=1751637899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0GAME STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720070/extras/f7e74dfd6e2d6931bf5c495aeded8f76.avif?t=1751637899\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You escaped from Alcatraz. You shook off the cops chasing you.<br>Now it\u2019s time to start a new life\u2014not by their rules, but by your own.<br>You open a pizza shop\u2014ordinary on the surface.<br>But behind the scenes, things are very different:<br>A doner stand in the basement, gambling tables upstairs, drug deals in the back room...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your ingredients, prepare the orders, keep your customers satisfied.<br>But be careful\u2014not every customer is a friend, and not every cop wears a uniform.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your empire and make a name for yourself in the criminal underworld.<br>But make one mistake... and you\u2019re caught.<br>If you get caught, it\u2019s back to prison.<br>To escape again, you\u2019ll need to use your wits\u2014solving dangerous puzzles, unlocking secret passages, racing against time...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to become the world\u2019s most dangerous pizza maker?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720070/extras/0ba9014c722beb4f1cd8f47417df341f.poster.avif?t=1751637899\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720070/extras/0ba9014c722beb4f1cd8f47417df341f.webm?t=1751637899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720070/extras/0ba9014c722beb4f1cd8f47417df341f.mp4?t=1751637899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 SHOP MANAGEMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720070/extras/0ac08f242231c22c1bfa2f0d8dd984a7.poster.avif?t=1751637899\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720070/extras/0ac08f242231c22c1bfa2f0d8dd984a7.webm?t=1751637899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720070/extras/0ac08f242231c22c1bfa2f0d8dd984a7.mp4?t=1751637899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf55 Pizza!!! Design Your Dream Shop, Take Flavor to the Top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t just make pizza\u2014build your very own pizzeria from the ground up!<br>Customize everything from the oven model to the neon sign, from the menu to the d\u00e9cor.<br>Create a one-of-a-kind atmosphere that draws customers in and makes your brand unforgettable!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 MAKE PIZZAS FOR CUSTOMERS BASED ON THEIR ORDERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720070/extras/7c6209388b897fac2f4178a018dd85ec.poster.avif?t=1751637899\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720070/extras/7c6209388b897fac2f4178a018dd85ec.webm?t=1751637899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720070/extras/7c6209388b897fac2f4178a018dd85ec.mp4?t=1751637899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf55 Pizza!!! \u2013 Slice Your Way to Success!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take full control\u2014from the dough to the sauce, from toppings to cook time.<br>Build a wide-ranging menu, from the classic Margherita to fully loaded creations.<br>Serve each order perfectly and on time.<br>Upgrade your shop, personalize the decoration, and rise to become the most beloved pizza place in town!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 YOUR SHOP, LIMITLESS MENU</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720070/extras/4ce25f9a6e846a66fada5caea04b1a11.poster.avif?t=1751637899\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720070/extras/4ce25f9a6e846a66fada5caea04b1a11.webm?t=1751637899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720070/extras/4ce25f9a6e846a66fada5caea04b1a11.mp4?t=1751637899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd59 Doner!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add mouthwatering options like d\u00f6ner and wraps to your menu and grow your customer base!<br>From the oven to the rotisserie grill, from the signage to the sauces\u2014you control every detail.<br>Craft your flavors with skill and turn your shop into the hottest spot in the city!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0DO YOU EAT MY PIZZA OR TAKE A BULLET?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca3 A Master Pizza Maker by Day, a Dangerous Player by Night!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day, it\u2019s long customer lines, sizzling pizzas, and a vibrant little shop...<br>But at night, things take a dark turn.<br>You\u2019re living a double life\u2014caught in illegal dealings, dirty money, secret trades, and shady connections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smuggled packages hidden between deliveries, secret messages in the menu, police raids, and turf wars with rival gangs\u2014this is your reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintain balance: be a successful business owner while climbing the ranks of the underground without leaving a trace.<br>But never forget... if you get caught, your next destination is Alcatraz.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720070/extras/2d50348a4ce523ce2c57f9f1c95ffb33.poster.avif?t=1751637899\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720070/extras/2d50348a4ce523ce2c57f9f1c95ffb33.webm?t=1751637899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720070/extras/2d50348a4ce523ce2c57f9f1c95ffb33.mp4?t=1751637899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0GAME STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720070/extras/f7e74dfd6e2d6931bf5c495aeded8f76.avif?t=1751637899\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You escaped from Alcatraz. You shook off the cops chasing you.<br>Now it\u2019s time to start a new life\u2014not by their rules, but by your own.<br>You open a pizza shop\u2014ordinary on the surface.<br>But behind the scenes, things are very different:<br>A doner stand in the basement, gambling tables upstairs, drug deals in the back room...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your ingredients, prepare the orders, keep your customers satisfied.<br>But be careful\u2014not every customer is a friend, and not every cop wears a uniform.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your empire and make a name for yourself in the criminal underworld.<br>But make one mistake... and you\u2019re caught.<br>If you get caught, it\u2019s back to prison.<b