nd up!<br>Customize everything from the oven model to the neon sign, from the menu to the d\u00e9cor.<br>Create a one-of-a-kind atmosphere that draws customers in and makes your brand unforgettable!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 MAKE PIZZAS FOR CUSTOMERS BASED ON THEIR ORDERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720070/extras/7c6209388b897fac2f4178a018dd85ec.poster.avif?t=1751637899\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720070/extras/7c6209388b897fac2f4178a018dd85ec.webm?t=1751637899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720070/extras/7c6209388b897fac2f4178a018dd85ec.mp4?t=1751637899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf55 Pizza!!! \u2013 Slice Your Way to Success!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take full control\u2014from the dough to the sauce, from toppings to cook time.<br>Build a wide-ranging menu, from the classic Margherita to fully loaded creations.<br>Serve each order perfectly and on time.<br>Upgrade your shop, personalize the decoration, and rise to become the most beloved pizza place in town!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 YOUR SHOP, LIMITLESS MENU</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720070/extras/4ce25f9a6e846a66fada5caea04b1a11.poster.avif?t=1751637899\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720070/extras/4ce25f9a6e846a66fada5caea04b1a11.webm?t=1751637899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720070/extras/4ce25f9a6e846a66fada5caea04b1a11.mp4?t=1751637899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd59 Doner!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add mouthwatering options like d\u00f6ner and wraps to your menu and grow your customer base!<br>From the oven to the rotisserie grill, from the signage to the sauces\u2014you control every detail.<br>Craft your flavors with skill and turn your shop into the hottest spot in the city!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0DO YOU EAT MY PIZZA OR TAKE A BULLET?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca3 A Master Pizza Maker by Day, a Dangerous Player by Night!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day, it\u2019s long customer lines, sizzling pizzas, and a vibrant little shop...<br>But at night, things take a dark turn.<br>You\u2019re living a double life\u2014caught in illegal dealings, dirty money, secret trades, and shady connections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smuggled packages hidden between deliveries, secret messages in the menu, police raids, and turf wars with rival gangs\u2014this is your reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintain balance: be a successful business owner while climbing the ranks of the underground without leaving a trace.<br>But never forget... if you get caught, your next destination is Alcatraz.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
